nt-id-r_2075a853eb16f025" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2925066281="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_2075a853eb16f025" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">没问题，通过具体的“场景案例”来学习是掌握 Vue 3 最快的方法。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">除了基础的展示数据，Vue 3 组件开发中最常见的三个核心场景分别是：<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="35">表单封装</b>、<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="40">逻辑复用</b>和<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="45">UI结构复用</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">以下是这三个场景的经典案例代码。</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">案例一：自定义搜索输入框 (封装 v-model)</h3><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">场景：</b> 你需要在多个页面使用一个长得一样的搜索框，并且需要父组件能直接用 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="37">v-model</code> 获取输入的值。
<b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="53">核心点：</b> Vue 3 中 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="66">v-model</code> 本质是 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="78">modelValue</code> 属性 + <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="94">update:modelValue</code> 事件。</p><p data-path-to-node="6"><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">SearchInput.vue</code> (子组件)</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-79 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block ng-tns-c115509130-79 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_2075a853eb16f025&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_d31a2fd90d1232aa&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwilq4rO-_uRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQpAE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c115509130-79 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-79">HTML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="buttons ng-tns-c115509130-79 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c115509130-79 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_2075a853eb16f025&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_d31a2fd90d1232aa&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c115509130-79"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c115509130-79"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-79"><code _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c115509130-79"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">script</span> <span class="hljs-attr">setup</span>&gt;</span><span class="javascript">
<span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 接收父组件 v-model 传来的值，默认叫 modelValue</span>
defineProps({
  <span class="hljs-attr">modelValue</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">String</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">placeholder</span>: {
    <span class="hljs-attr">type</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">String</span>,
    <span class="hljs-attr">default</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'请输入搜索内容...'</span>
  }
})

<span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 定义更新事件</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> emit = defineEmits([<span class="hljs-string">'update:modelValue'</span>, <span class="hljs-string">'search'</span>])

<span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 处理输入</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> handleInput = <span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params">e</span>) =&gt;</span> {
  <span class="hljs-comment">// 触发 update:modelValue，父组件的数据会自动更新</span>
  emit(<span class="hljs-string">'update:modelValue'</span>, e.target.value)
}

<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> handleEnter = <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> {
  emit(<span class="hljs-string">'search'</span>) <span class="hljs-comment">// 按下回车触发搜索</span>
}
</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">script</span>&gt;</span>

<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">template</span>&gt;</span>
  <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"search-box"</span>&gt;</span>
    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">i</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"icon-search"</span>&gt;</span>🔍<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">i</span>&gt;</span>
    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">input</span> 
      <span class="hljs-attr">:value</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"modelValue"</span>
      @<span class="hljs-attr">input</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"handleInput"</span>
      @<span class="hljs-attr">keyup.enter</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"handleEnter"</span>
      <span class="hljs-attr">:placeholder</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"placeholder"</span>
