e-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_c3ee202b8e9c5388" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这个综合案例将是你 Vue 3 组件化思维的<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="22">毕业设计</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">我们将构建一个**“智能数据列表组件” (SmartList)**。它的特点是：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">自动管理状态</b>：自己处理 Loading（加载中）、Error（出错）、Empty（空数据）三种状态。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">逻辑抽离</b>：数据请求逻辑封装在 Hook 中。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">UI 极度灵活</b>：它只负责循环数据，至于每一行长什么样（是只有文字，还是带头像，还是带按钮），完全由父组件决定（使用<b data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="57">作用域插槽</b>）。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="3">这个模式在企业级后台管理系统（Admin Dashboard）中无处不在。</p><hr data-path-to-node="4"><h3 data-path-to-node="5">1. 逻辑层：模拟数据请求 Hook (<code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="20">useMockFetch.js</code>)</h3><p data-path-to-node="6">为了让你能直接运行代码看到效果，我们用 <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="20">setTimeout</code> 模拟一个异步请求。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-102 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block ng-tns-c115509130-102 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_c3ee202b8e9c5388&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_058b32beb6971b29&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwilq4rO-_uRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQwAE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c115509130-102 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-102">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="buttons ng-tns-c115509130-102 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c115509130-102 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_c3ee202b8e9c5388&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_058b32beb6971b29&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c115509130-102"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c115509130-102"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-102"><code _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c115509130-102"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { ref } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">'vue'</span>

<span class="hljs-comment">// 接收一个模拟的 API 名称，返回响应式数据和状态</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">useMockFetch</span>(<span class="hljs-params">apiName</span>) </span>{
  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> data = ref([])
  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> loading = ref(<span class="hljs-literal">false</span>)
  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> error = ref(<span class="hljs-literal">null</span>)

  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> loadData = <span class="hljs-keyword">async</span> () =&gt; {
    loading.value = <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>
    error.value = <span class="hljs-literal">null</span>
    data.value = []

    <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> {
      <span class="hljs-comment">// 模拟网络延迟 1秒</span>
      <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">Promise</span>(<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-params">resolve</span> =&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">setTimeout</span>(resolve, <span class="hljs-number">1000</span>))
      
      <span class="hljs-comment">// 模拟根据不同 API 返回不同数据</span>
      <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (apiName === <span class="hljs-string">'getUsers'</span>) {
        data.value = [
          { <span class="hljs-attr">id</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">name</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'艾伦'</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">role</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'调查兵团'</span> },
          { <span class="hljs-attr">id</span>: <span class="hljs-number">2</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">name</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'三笠'</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">role</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'特种兵'</span> }
        ]
      } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (apiName === <span class="hljs-string">'getProducts'</span>) {
        data.value = [
          { <span class="hljs-attr">id</span>: <span class="hljs-number">101</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">title</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'立体机动装置'</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">price</span>: <span class="hljs-number">999</span> },
          { <span class="hljs-attr">id</span>: <span class="hljs-number">102</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">title</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'硬质化水晶'</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">price</span>: <span class="hljs-number">5000</span> }
        ]
      } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
        <span class="hljs-keyword">throw</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">Error</span>(<span class="hljs-string">'404 Not Found'</span>)
      }
    } <span class="hljs-keyword">catch</span> (err) {
      error.value = err.message
    } <span class="hljs-keyword">finally</span> {
      loading.value = <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>
    }
  }

  <span class="hljs-comment">// 自动执行一次</span>
  loadData()

  <span class="hljs-comment">// 返回给组件使用</span>
  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> { data, loading, error, <span class="hljs-attr">reload</span>: loadData }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="8"><h3 data-path-to-node="9">2. 组件层：通用的列表壳子 (<code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="16">SmartList.vue</code>)</h3><p data-path-to-node="10">这是本案例的核心。注意看它是如何使用 <code data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="19">&lt;slot&gt;</code> 把数据“反向”传给父组件的。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-103 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block ng-tns-c115509130-103 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_c3ee202b8e9c5388&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_058b32beb6971b29&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwilq4rO-_uRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQwQE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c115509130-103 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-103">HTML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="buttons ng-tns-c115509130-103 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c115509130-103 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-