</p><p data-path-to-node="21">下一步，通常我们会离开“单个组件”的范畴，进入“全应用级”的状态管理。
<b data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="36">你想了解 Vue 3 官方推荐的状态管理库 Pinia 吗？它解决了“多组件共享数据”（比如用户信息、购物车）的问题。</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" _nghost-ng-c427815498="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3217591318="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3217591318-85"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3249768162="" class="ng-tns-c3249768162-96 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3249768162="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3249768162-96 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3249768162="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3249768162-96 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3249768162="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c3249768162-96"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3249768162="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c3249768162-96"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197814349="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197814349="" class="conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-i