id-r_6763b72c58736335" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2925066281="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_6763b72c58736335" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">太棒了。掌握了组件（Props/Emits/Slots）是“局部战争”的胜利，而掌握 <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="43">Pinia</b> 则是赢得了“全局战役”。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">在 Vue 3 开发中，当你的应用变大，你会发现：<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="25">组件之间传值太累了</b>。比如“用户头像”这个数据，可能Header组件要用，侧边栏要用，设置页也要用。如果用 Props 一层层传，会累死。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">这时就需要 <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="6">Pinia</b>。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">什么是 Pinia？</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">用你熟悉的 <b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="6">Java/后端</b> 概念来打比方：</p><ul data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">组件 (Components):</b> 就像一个个 <code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="23">Controller</code> 或 <code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="36">Class</code>，它们处理局部逻辑。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Pinia:</b> 就像应用内存中的 <b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="16">Redis</b> 或者 Spring 的 <b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="34">Singleton Service（单例服务）</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,2,0">它是一个<b data-path-to-node="5,2,0" data-index-in-node="4">全局的大仓库</b>，里面的数据（State），任何组件都能直接去拿，直接去改（通过 Actions）。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="6"><h3 data-path-to-node="7">实战案例：全局用户登录状态管理</h3><p data-path-to-node="8">我们模拟一个最常见的场景：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="9"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">UserStore (仓库):</b> 存放当前登录用户的信息。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">LoginComponent (组件A):</b> 负责点击登录，修改仓库里的数据。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">HeaderComponent (组件B):</b> 负责监听仓库，实时显示“欢迎你，xxx”。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="10">这两个组件在页面上可能隔得很远，但它们通过 Pinia 共享数据。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="11">第一步：定义仓库 (<code data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="10">/stores/userStore.js</code>)</h4><p data-path-to-node="12">Pinia 的写法和你刚才学的 <code data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="16">&lt;script setup&gt;</code> 惊人的一致（这被称为 <b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="42">Setup Store</b> 写法）。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-132 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block ng-tns-c115509130-132 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6763b72c58736335&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_6bbdcbe7115eb6e7&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwilq4rO-_uRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ4wE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c115509130-132 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-132">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="buttons ng-tns-c115509130-132 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c115509130-132 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6763b72c58736335&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_6bbdcbe7115eb6e7&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c115509130-132"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c115509130-132"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-132"><code _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c115509130-132"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { defineStore } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">'pinia'</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { ref, computed } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">'vue'</span>

<span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 定义并导出 Store</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">// 第一个参数是唯一 ID ('user')</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> useUserStore = defineStore(<span class="hljs-string">'user'</span>, <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> {
  
  <span class="hljs-comment">// --- State (相当于 Java 类的成员变量) ---</span>
  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> userInfo = ref(<span class="hljs-literal">null</span>)
  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> token = ref(<span class="hljs-string">''</span>)

  <span class="hljs-comment">// --- Getters (相当于 get 方法，带缓存) ---</span>
  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> isLoggedIn = computed(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> {
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> !!token.value <span class="hljs-comment">// 如果有 token 就算登录了</span>
  })
  
  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> welcomeMessage = computed(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> {
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (isLoggedIn.value) {
      <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">`欢迎回来，<span class="hljs-subst">${userInfo.value.name}</span>！`</span>
    }
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">'请先登录'</span>
  })

  <span class="hljs-comment">// --- Actions (相当于 Service 层的方法，处理业务逻辑) ---</span>
  <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">login</span>(<span class="hljs-params">username, password</span>) </span>{
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 模拟后端登录请求</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (password === <span class="hljs-string">'123456'</span>) {
      userInfo.value = { <span class="hljs-attr">name</span>: username, <span class="hljs-attr">role</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'admin'</span> }
      token.value = <span class="hljs-string">'fake-jwt-token-xyz'</span>
      <span class="hljs-built_in">console</span>.log(<span class="hljs-string">'登录成功，数据已存入 Pinia'</span>)
    } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
      alert(<span class="hljs-string">'密码错误'</span>)
    }
  }

  <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">logout</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) </span>{
    userInfo.value = <span class="hljs-literal">null</span>
    token.value = <span class="hljs-string">''</span>
  }

  <span class="hljs-comment">// 必须把需要暴露给组件的东西 return 出去</span>
  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> { 
    userInfo, 
    token, 
    isLoggedIn, 
    welcomeMessage, 
    login, 
    logout 
  }
})
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="14"><h4 data-path-to-node="15">第二步：组件 A - 登录操作 (<code data-path-to-node="15" data-index-in-node="17">LoginPanel.vue</code>)</h4><p data-path-to-node="16">这个组件负责<b data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="6">写数据</b>（调用 Action）。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-133 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block ng-tns-c115509130-133 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6763b72c58736335&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_6bbdcbe7115eb6e7&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwilq4rO-_uRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ5AE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c115509130-133 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-133">HTML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="buttons ng-tns-c115509130-133 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c115509130-133 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6763b72c58736335&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_6bbdcbe7115eb6e7&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c115509130-133"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c115509130-133"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-133"><code _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c115509130-133"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">script</span> <span class="hljs-attr">setup</span>&gt;</span><span class="javascript">
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { ref } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">'vue'</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 引入刚才定义的 store hook</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { useUserStore } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">'./stores/userStore'</span>

<span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 实例化 store</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> userStore = useUserStore()

<span class="hljs-comment">// 本地表单变量</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> username = ref(<span class="hljs-string">''</span>)
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> password = ref(<span class="hljs-string">''</span>)

<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> handleLogin = <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> {
  <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 直接调用 store 里的 action</span>
  userStore.login(username.value, password.value)
}
</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">script</span>&gt;</span>

<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">template</span>&gt;</span>
  <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"login-box"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">v-if</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"!userStore.isLoggedIn"</span>&gt;</span>
    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h3</span>&gt;</span>用户登录<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h3</span>&gt;</span>
    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">input</span> <span class="hljs-attr">v-model</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"username"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">placeholder</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"用户名"</span> /&gt;</span>
    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">input</span> <span class="hljs-attr">v-model</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"password"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">type</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"password"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">placeholder</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"密码 (123456)"</span> /&gt;</span>
    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">button</span> @<span class="hljs-attr">click</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"handleLogin"</span>&gt;</span>登录<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">button</span>&gt;</span>
  <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span>
  
  <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">v-else</span>&gt;</span>
    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>您已经登录了，快去看看 Header 吧！<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>
    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">button</span> @<span class="hljs-attr">click</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"userStore.logout()"</span>&gt;</span>退出登录<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">button</span>&gt;</span>
  <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span>
<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">template</span>&gt;</span>

<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">style</span> <span class="hljs-attr">scoped</span>&gt;</span><span class="css">
<span class="hljs-selector-class">.login-box</span> { <span class="hljs-attribute">border</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1px</span> solid <span class="hljs-number">#ddd</span>; <span class="hljs-attribute">padding</span>: <span class="hljs-number">20px</span>; <span class="hljs-attribute">width</span>: <span class="hljs-number">200px</span>; }
