lass="thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3788320541="" class="ng-tns-c3788320541-139 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" xapautoid="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c3788320541-139 is-mobile" id="xap-auto-id-6"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c3788320541-139"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c3788320541-139 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3788320541-139"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" class="ng-tns-c3788320541-139">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3788320541-139"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3788320541-139 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3764099196="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3764099196="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3764099196="" _nghost-ng-c2925066281="" id="message-content-id-r_7f92279e4caa7234" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2925066281="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_7f92279e4caa7234" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">掌握 <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="3">Vue Router</b> 是构建单页应用（SPA）的最后一步。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">如果把 Pinia 比作后端的数据库/内存，那么 <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="25">Vue Router 就是后端的 Controller 层</b>。它的核心职责是将浏览器的 <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="68">URL 路径</b> 映射到具体的 <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="82">Vue 组件</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">特别是你提到的<b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="7">权限拦截</b>（比如：没登录不能看后台），在 Vue 中这被称为 <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="37">“导航守卫” (Navigation Guards)</b>，概念上完全等同于 Java Spring 中的 <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="88">Interceptors (拦截器)</b> 或 <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="109">Filters (过滤器)</b>。</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">第一步：定义路由表 (<code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="11">router/index.js</code>)</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">我们需要创建一个路由配置文件，告诉 Vue：“当用户访问 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="29">/login</code> 时，请显示 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="42">Login.vue</code> 组件”。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-164 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block ng-tns-c115509130-164 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_7f92279e4caa7234&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_a3eda8f258fe8f75&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwilq4rO-_uRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhwI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c115509130-164 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-164">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="buttons ng-tns-c115509130-164 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c115509130-164 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_7f92279e4caa7234&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_a3eda8f258fe8f75&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c115509130-164"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c115509130-164"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-164"><code _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c115509130-164"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { createRouter, createWebHistory } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">'vue-router'</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">// 引入你的组件</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> Home <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">'../views/Home.vue'</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> Login <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">'../views/Login.vue'</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> Dashboard <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">'../views/Dashboard.vue'</span>

<span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 定义路由规则</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> routes = [
  { 
    <span class="hljs-attr">path</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'/'</span>, 
    <span class="hljs-attr">component</span>: Home,
    <span class="hljs-attr">name</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'Home'</span>
  },
  { 
    <span class="hljs-attr">path</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'/login'</span>, 
    <span class="hljs-attr">component</span>: Login,
    <span class="hljs-attr">name</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'Login'</span>
  },
  { 
    <span class="hljs-attr">path</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'/dashboard'</span>, 
    <span class="hljs-attr">component</span>: Dashboard,
    <span class="hljs-attr">name</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'Dashboard'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 【关键点】：使用 meta 元数据标记该路由需要“登录权限”</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">meta</span>: { <span class="hljs-attr">requiresAuth</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">true</span> } 
  }
]

<span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 创建路由实例</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> router = createRouter({
  <span class="hljs-comment">// 使用 HTML5 模式 (没有 # 号，像普通网站一样)</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">history</span>: createWebHistory(),
  routes
})

<span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">default</span> router
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="7"><h3 data-path-to-node="8">第二步：实现“拦截器” (全局前置守卫)</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">这是最精彩的部分。我们要在路由跳转<b data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="17">之前</b>插入一段逻辑。</p><p data-path-to-node="10">我们结合上一节学的 <b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="10">Pinia</b>，如果用户没登录（Pinia 里没 token），强行把他踢回登录页。</p><p data-path-to-node="11"><b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="0">继续在 <code data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="4">router/index.js</code> 中添加：</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-165 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block ng-tns-c115509130-165 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_7f92279e4caa7234&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_a3eda8f258fe8f75&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwilq4rO-_uRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQiAI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c115509130-165 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-165">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="buttons ng-tns-c115509130-165 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c115509130-165 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_7f92279e4caa7234&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_a3eda8f258fe8f75&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c115509130-165"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c115509130-165"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-165"><code _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c115509130-165"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { useUserStore } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">'../stores/userStore'</span> <span class="hljs-comment">// 引入之前的 Store</span>

<span class="hljs-comment">// beforeEach 相当于 Spring 的 preHandle 拦截器</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">// to: 要去哪里？</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">// from: 从哪里来？</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">// next: 放行函数 (Vue Router 4 中可以直接 return 路径，不用 next 也行)</span>
router.beforeEach(<span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params">to, <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span>) =&gt;</span> {
  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> userStore = useUserStore()
  
  <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 判断该路由是否需要登录权限 (检查 meta 字段)</span>
  <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (to.meta.requiresAuth) {
    
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 检查 Store 里有没有 token</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!userStore.isLoggedIn) {
      <span class="hljs-built_in">console</span>.warn(<span class="hljs-string">'拦截：用户未登录，跳转至登录页'</span>)
      
      <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 重定向到登录页，并带上 redirect 参数，方便登录后跳回来</span>
      <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> { 
        <span class="hljs-attr">path</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'/login'</span>, 
