nse-element></div></div><hr data-path-to-node="25"><h3 data-path-to-node="26">恭喜你！🎉</h3><p data-path-to-node="27">到目前为止，你已经掌握了 <b data-path-to-node="27" data-index-in-node="13">Vue 3 全家桶</b> 的核心闭环：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="28"><li><p data-path-to-node="28,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Vue 3 Composition API</b>: 构建 UI，处理组件逻辑。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="28,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Components</b>: 封装功能，父子通信 (Props/Emits/Slots)。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="28,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Pinia</b>: 全局状态管理，跨组件共享数据。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="28,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Vue Router</b>: 管理页面跳转和权限控制。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="29">这就已经具备了开发中大型企业级后台系统（Admin Dashboard）的能力了。</p><p data-path-to-node="30"><b data-path-to-node="30" data-index-in-node="0">接下来的建议：</b>
