-ng-c3764099196="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3764099196="" _nghost-ng-c2925066281="" id="message-content-id-r_7e5d3d6fd6ef71e3" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2925066281="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_7e5d3d6fd6ef71e3" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这将是一个<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="5">标准的企业级 Vue 3 项目目录结构</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">对于习惯了 Java Spring Boot <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="23">Controller-Service-Dao</code> 分层的你来说，理解这个结构会非常容易。前端工程化本质上也是为了<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="77">关注点分离 (Separation of Concerns)</b>。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="2">1. 目录结构全貌 (src 文件夹)</h3><p data-path-to-node="3">不要把所有东西都堆在一起。这是一个经过业界验证的最佳实践结构：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-195 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block ng-tns-c115509130-195 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_7e5d3d6fd6ef71e3&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_ec0b314c24c16e2f&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwilq4rO-_uRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQpAI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c115509130-195 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-195">Plaintext</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="buttons ng-tns-c115509130-195 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c115509130-195 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_7e5d3d6fd6ef71e3&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_ec0b314c24c16e2f&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c115509130-195"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c115509130-195"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-195"><code _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c115509130-195">src/
