打开项目后，请第一时间查看这几个文件，你就知道怎么改了：</p><ul data-path-to-node="35"><li><p data-path-to-node="35,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="35,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="35,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">src/api/</code></b>: 这里面全是接口定义。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="35,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="35,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="35,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">src/views/proTable/</code></b>: 这是一个超级强大的表格示例，<b data-path-to-node="35,1,0" data-index-in-node="35">必看</b>。它演示了如何把 <code data-path-to-node="35,1,0" data-index-in-node="46">el-table</code> 和后端的分页接口完美对接，甚至不需要你手动写 <code data-path-to-node="35,1,0" data-index-in-node="78">&lt;el-table-column&gt;</code>，全是配置化的。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="35,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="35,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="35,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">src/routers/modules/dynamicRouter.ts</code></b>: 这里看它是怎么处理后端传回来的菜单数据的。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="36"><h3 data-path-to-node="37">下一步建议</h3><p data-path-to-node="38">下载并跑起来之后，你可能会遇到一个问题：<b data-path-to-node="38" data-index-in-node="20">跨域 (CORS)</b>。
因为前端在 <code data-path-to-node="38" data-index-in-node="37">localhost:3000</code>，你的 Spring Boot 在 <code data-path-to-node="38" data-index-in-node="69">localhost:8080</code>。</p><p data-path-to-node="39"><b data-path-to-node="39" data-index-in-node="0">你需要知道如何在 Vite 中配置代理 (Proxy) 来解决开发环境的跨域问题吗？</b> (这是前后端分离开发的第一道坎)。</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" _nghost-ng-c427815498="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3217591318="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3217591318-232"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3249768162="" class="ng-tns-c3249768162-244 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3249768162="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3249768162-244 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3249768162="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3249768162-244 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3249768162="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c3249768162-244"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3249768162="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c3249768162-244"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197814349="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----