"thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3788320541="" class="ng-tns-c3788320541-257 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" xapautoid="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c3788320541-257 is-mobile" id="xap-auto-id-10"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c3788320541-257"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c3788320541-257 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3788320541-257"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" class="ng-tns-c3788320541-257">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3788320541-257"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3788320541-257 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3764099196="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3764099196="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3764099196="" _nghost-ng-c2925066281="" id="message-content-id-r_716633af659861ff" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2925066281="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_716633af659861ff" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">解决跨域（CORS）问题是前后端分离开发的第一道门槛。如果不配置这个，你的浏览器控制台会飘满红色的 <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="50">Access-Control-Allow-Origin</code> 错误。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">在 Vue 3 + Vite 的开发环境中，我们不需要修改 Java 后端代码（不需要在 Spring Boot 里加 <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="60">@CrossOrigin</code>），而是利用 Vite 自带的 <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="88">开发服务器代理 (Dev Server Proxy)</b> 来欺骗浏览器。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="2">核心原理</h3><p data-path-to-node="3">浏览器有安全策略，禁止 <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="12">localhost:3000</code> (前端) 直接访问 <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="37">localhost:8080</code> (后端)。
<b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="58">代理的作用是：</b> 浏览器把请求发给同源的 Vite 开发服务器，Vite 服务器（它是 Node.js 写的，不受浏览器策略限制）再把请求转发给 Spring Boot。</p><hr data-path-to-node="4"><h3 data-path-to-node="5">1. 修改配置文件 (<code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="11">vite.config.ts</code>)</h3><p data-path-to-node="6">打开项目根目录下的 <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="10">vite.config.ts</code> (或 <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="28">.js</code>)，找到 <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="36">server</code> 配置项。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-272 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block ng-tns-c115509130-272 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_716633af659861ff&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_41b38dd6b688db3d&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwilq4rO-_uRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ8wI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c115509130-272 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-272">TypeScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="buttons ng-tns-c115509130-272 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c115509130-272 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_716633af659861ff&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_41b38dd6b688db3d&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c115509130-272"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c115509130-272"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-272"><code _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c115509130-272"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> { defineConfig } <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">'vite'</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> vue <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">'@vitejs/plugin-vue'</span>

<span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">default</span> defineConfig({
  <span class="hljs-attr">plugins</span>: [vue()],
  
  <span class="hljs-comment">// --- 核心配置开始 ---</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">server</span>: {
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 设置前端启动端口，通常是 3000 或 5173</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">port</span>: <span class="hljs-number">3000</span>, 
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 是否自动并在浏览器打开</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">open</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>,
    
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 【重点】代理配置</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">proxy</span>: {
      <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 拦截器：只要 URL 包含了 '/api'，就由代理处理</span>
      <span class="hljs-string">'/api'</span>: {
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 目标地址：代理要把请求转发给谁？(你的 Spring Boot 地址)</span>
        <span class="hljs-attr">target</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'http://localhost:8080'</span>,
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 允许跨域：控制请求头中的 Host 字段，让后端觉得是自己人在访问</span>
        <span class="hljs-attr">changeOrigin</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>,
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 4. 路径重写 (最容易踩坑的地方！)</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 解释：前端发 '/api/login'，但后端接口其实是 '/login'</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 所以要用 rewrite 把 '/api' 抹除掉，变成空字符串</span>
        <span class="hljs-attr">rewrite</span>: <span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params">path</span>) =&gt;</span> path.replace(<span class="hljs-regexp">/^\/api/</span>, <span class="hljs-string">''</span>)
      }
    }
  }
  <span class="hljs-comment">// --- 核心配置结束 ---</span>
})
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="8"><h3 data-path-to-node="9">2. 配合修改 Axios 配置</h3><p data-path-to-node="10">配置了代理后，你的 Axios <code data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="16">baseURL</code> 也要跟着变。你不再需要写死 <code data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="38">http://localhost:8080</code>，而是写相对路径 <code data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="68">/api</code>。</p><p data-path-to-node="11">在你的 <code data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="4">src/utils/request.js</code> (或者 <code data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="29">.env.development</code> 环境变量文件) 中：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-273 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block ng-tns-c115509130-273 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_716633af659861ff&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_41b38dd6b688db3d&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwilq4rO-_uRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ9AI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c115509130-273 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-273">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="buttons ng-tns-c115509130-273 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c115509130-273 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_716633af659861ff&quot;,&quot;c_8b50c378e6bd4f38&quot;,null,&quot;rc_41b38dd6b688db3d&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c115509130-273"><div _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c115509130-273"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" class="ng-tns-c115509130-273"><code _ngcontent-ng-c115509130="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c115509130-273"><span class="hljs-comment">// .env.development 文件内容推荐写法:</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">// VITE_API_URL = '/api'</span>

<span class="hljs-comment">// src/utils/request.js 中:</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> service = axios.create({
  <span class="hljs-comment">// 这里取到的就是 '/api'</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">baseURL</span>: <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span>.meta.env.VITE_API_URL, 
  <span class="hljs-attr">timeout</span>: <span class="hljs-number">5000</span>
})
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="13">3. 请求流向全解析 (Debug 指南)</h3><p data-path-to-node="14">假设你在组件里发起了一个请求：<code data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="15">axios.get('/users')</code> (配合 baseURL 后实际请求 URL 是 <code data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="59">/api/users</code>)。</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="15"><li><p data-path-to-node="15,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">浏览器发出：</b> <code data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="7">http://localhost:3000/api/users</code></p><ul data-path-to-node="15,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="15,0,1,0,0">浏览器一看：目标也是 3000 端口，同源！<b data-path-to-node="15,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="22">放行</b>。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Vite 服务器接收：</b> 发现路径以 <code data-path-to-node="15,1,0" data-index-in-node="18">/api</code> 开头，触发代理配置。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Vite 路径重写：</b> 根据 <code data-path-to-node="15,2,0" data-index-in-node="14">rewrite</code> 规则，把 <code data-path-to-node="15,2,0" data-index-in-node="27">/api/users</code> 变成 <code data-path-to-node="15,2,0" data-index-in-node="41">/users</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Vite 转发：</b> 偷偷向 <code data-path-to-node="15,3,0" data-index-in-node="13">http://localhost:8080/users</code> 发起请求。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Spring Boot 响应：</b> 收到 <code data-path-to-node="15,4,0" data-index-in-node="19">/users</code> 请求，返回 JSON 数据。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,5,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,5,0" data-index-in-node="0">Vite 回传：</b> 把 JSON 数据转交给浏览器。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="16"><h3 data-path-to-node="17">常见“坑”与排查</h3><p data-path-to-node="18"><b data-path-to-node="18" data-index-in-node="0">Q1: 后端接口本来就带 <code data-path-to-node="18" data-index-in-node="13">/api</code> 怎么办？（例如 <code data-path-to-node="18" data-index-in-node="26">localhost:8080/api/users</code>）</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="19"><li><p data-path-to-node="19,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="19,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">A:</b> 那就<b data-path-to-node="19,0,0" data-index-in-node="5">不要</b>写 <code data-path-to-node="19,0,0" data-index-in-node="9">rewrite</code> 配置，或者把 rewrite 去掉。保留 <code data-path-to-node="19,0,0" data-index-in-node="38">/api</code> 发给后端。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="20"><b data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="0">Q2: 为什么浏览器 Network 面板里看到的 Request URL 还是 <code data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="41">localhost:3000</code>？</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="21"><li><p data-path-to-node="21,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="21,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">A:</b> 这是正常的！代理是<b data-path-to-node="21,0,0" data-index-in-node="12">服务器端</b>的行为，浏览器只知道它发给了 Vite (3000)。你看不到 Vite 转发给 8080 的过程。如果你看到 Request URL 变成了 8080，说明代理<b data-path-to-node="21,0,0" data-index-in-node="97">没生效</b>。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="22"><b data-path-to-node="22" data-index-in-node="0">Q3: 这个配置上线（生产环境）有用吗？</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="23"><li><p data-path-to-node="23,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="23,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">A:</b> <b data-path-to-node="23,0,0" data-index-in-node="3">完全没用！</b> <code data-path-to-node="23,0,0" data-index-in-node="9">vite.config.ts</code> 里的 <code data-path-to-node="23,0,0" data-index-in-node="27">server.proxy</code> 仅在开发环境 (<code data-path-to-node="23,0,0" data-index-in-node="48">npm run dev</code>) 有效。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="23,1,0">项目打包 (<code data-path-to-node="23,1,0" data-index-in-node="6">npm run build</code>) 后，生成的是纯静态 HTML/CSS/JS 文件，没有 Vite 服务器了。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="23,2,0">生产环境需要用 <b data-path-to-node="23,2,0" data-index-in-node="8">Nginx</b> 来做反向代理（原理和这个一样，只是工具变了）。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="24"><p data-path-to-node="25">你现在的项目已经：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="26"><li><p data-path-to-node="26,0,0">有了 <b data-path-to-node="26,0,0" data-index-in-node="3">Vue 3</b> 代码结构。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="26,1,0">有了 <b data-path-to-node="26,1,0" data-index-in-node="3">Element Plus</b> 界面。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="26,2,0">有了 <b data-path-to-node="26,2,0" data-index-in-node="3">Axios</b> 封装。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="26,3,0">解决了 <b data-path-to-node="26,3,0" data-index-in-node="4">跨域</b> 问题。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="27">此时你已经可以愉快地进行本地全栈开发了。</p><p data-path-to-node="28"><b data-path-to-node="28" data-index-in-node="0">当你的项目开发完成，准备部署给用户使用时，就需要进行“打包构建”。</b>
你想了解最后一步：<b data-path-to-node="28" data-index-in-node="43">如何构建生产环境包，并使用 Nginx 部署到 Linux 服务器上吗？</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" _nghost-ng-c427815498="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3217591318="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3217591318-255"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3249768162="" class="ng-tns-c3249768162-267 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3249768162="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3249768162-267 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3249768162="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3249768162-267 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3249768162="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c3249768162-267"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3249768162="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c3249768162-267"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197814349="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197814349="" class="conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-inserted"