/div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3788320541-276"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3788320541="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3788320541-276 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2257363295="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3764099196="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3764099196="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3764099196="" _nghost-ng-c2925066281="" id="message-content-id-r_80b35e46c2a3e2b3" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2925066281="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_80b35e46c2a3e2b3" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">如果说 <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="4">Element Plus</b> 是前端的“界面积木”，那么 <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="31">VueUse</b> 就是前端的“瑞士军刀”。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">对于 Java 开发者来说，<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="14">VueUse 之于 Vue，就像 Apache Commons / Hutool / Guava 之于 Java</b>。它封装了数百个通用的工具函数（Hooks），帮你处理浏览器 API、状态管理、传感器交互等，让你少写大量的样板代码。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">这里为你精选了开发中<b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="10">最常用、最值得掌握</b>的几个核心工具函数。</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">1. 状态持久化：<code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="9">useStorage</code> (神器)</h3><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">场景：</b> 你想把用户的“侧边栏折叠状态”或“Token”存到 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="30">localStorage</code> 里，并在页面刷新后保持。
<b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="56">传统写法：</b> 手动写 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="66">localStorage.getItem</code>，还得 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="90">JSON.parse</code>，改了数据还得 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="108">setItem</code>。
